          "filename": "Melaleuca.Sp lahan basah TN Wasur.jpg",
          "caption": "Wasur National Park in Merauke is one of the national parks in Indonesia, located in the province of Papua, in the easternmost city of Indonesia. This National Park is a national park with the largest wetlands in Indonesia, this place is dominated by vegetation of the melaleuca.sp species that are scattered throughout the national park. Also, it is home for  kanguru pohon (Dendrolagus spadix), kesturi raja (Psittrichus fulgidus), kasuari gelambir (Casuarius casuarius sclateri) and other faunas.",
